guide.title=Workshop guide
guide.intro=Kinetics 0.2: shafts, gears and water wheels resolve server-side networks. Read each component page. Development: in-game import and execution still need validation.
guide.examples=Example recipes
guide.recipes=Crafting table: copper + iron nugget = gear component; iron ingot = shaft component. One component makes its block. Book + copper = guide. These are original development recipes, not verified Create recipes.
