entity.bedrockworks:visual_shaft.name=Mechanical shaft
guide.shaft.title=Mechanical shaft
guide.shaft.body=Aligned shafts connect end to end at 1:1. Placement follows the clicked face. Sneak-interact to cycle X/Y/Z. Recipe: iron → shaft component → shaft.
entity.bedrockworks:visual_gear.name=Small gear
guide.gear.title=Small gear
guide.gear.body=Coaxial connection is 1:1. Adjacent coplanar small gears reverse direction. Diagonally meshed with a large gear it turns twice as fast in reverse. Recipe: copper + iron nugget → gear component → gear.
tile.bedrockworks:large_gear.name=Large gear
entity.bedrockworks:visual_large_gear.name=Large gear
guide.large_gear.title=Large gear
guide.large_gear.body=Place a small gear diagonally in the shared rotation plane: large → small = -2; small → large = -0.5. Perpendicular large gears also mesh diagonally. Recipe: small gear + copper + iron.
tile.bedrockworks:gearbox.name=Gearbox
entity.bedrockworks:visual_gearbox.name=Gearbox
guide.gearbox.title=Gearbox
guide.gearbox.body=The selected axis blocks two faces; the other four are ports. Y axis: X/Z ports. Sneak-interact to rotate. Direction depends on input/output ports. Recipe: 2 small gears + iron.
tile.bedrockworks:water_wheel.name=Water wheel
entity.bedrockworks:visual_water_wheel.name=Water wheel
guide.water_wheel.title=Water wheel
guide.water_wheel.body=Generates ±8 RPM and 256 SU when falling water touches a tangential side. Side water must have liquid_depth >= 8 and water directly above. Opposite sides cancel; still water does not work. X axle uses Z sides; Z axle uses X sides. Y axle is disabled. Recipe: shaft + 2 oak planks + copper.
tile.bedrockworks:test_source.name=Test source (development)
entity.bedrockworks:visual_test_source.name=Test source (development)
guide.test_source.title=Test source (development)
guide.test_source.body=Development source: interact to cycle off, +8/+16/+32/+64 and -8/-16/-32/-64 RPM. Supplies 32 SU per RPM. Incompatible source speeds stop the network. Development recipe: gearbox + redstone + diamond.
tile.bedrockworks:speed_meter.name=Speed gauge
entity.bedrockworks:visual_speed_meter.name=Speed gauge
guide.speed_meter.title=Speed gauge
guide.speed_meter.body=Look at the block within 6 blocks: needle and action bar display actual RPM, stress and state. No stress impact. Recipe: shaft + compass + copper.
tile.bedrockworks:stress_meter.name=Stress gauge / brake
entity.bedrockworks:visual_stress_meter.name=Stress gauge / brake
guide.stress_meter.title=Stress gauge / brake
guide.stress_meter.body=Needle shows stress/capacity. Interact to cycle a 0/8/64 SU per RPM brake; this is a Bedrock test extension, not the passive Java gauge. Over-capacity stops the whole network. Sneak-interact changes the axis. Recipe: speed gauge + iron.
