manual.name.d234107971a1280ce71e=Filtered mechanical funnel
manual.item.d234107971a1280ce71e.description=Moves entire stacks between two vanilla barrels with one native move, without item entities.
manual.item.d234107971a1280ce71e.operation=Between two horizontal barrels: takes from behind and delivers ahead. With an empty hand, normal interaction switches input (ingots) / output (sheets); sneak-interact rotates north/east/south/west. The action bar shows mode and direction.
manual.item.d234107971a1280ce71e.energy=Passive, requires no kinetic power. Checks up to four slots per side per visit and moves into an empty slot.
manual.item.d234107971a1280ce71e.example=Input barrel → input-mode funnel → barrel under press → output-mode funnel → product barrel. First test with one ingot per slot.
manual.item.d234107971a1280ce71e.errors=Does not merge stacks or move custom-data items. Does not transport materials outside pressing recipes. Stops when the output is full. This is a subset of Java funnels.
