manual.family.fan_smoking_blasting=The fan queries world smoking, smelting and blasting registries and excludes manual_only recipes. Selection depends on active recipes, not a fixed add-on list.
manual.family.basin_shapeless=The basin can convert eligible Java shapeless recipes. Ingredients and results depend on the world registry.
manual.family.potion_mixing=Generates mixes for registered containers and potions, including mod brewing. The generator uses 1000 mB fluids and HEATED heat; no Java world registry was enumerated.
manual.family.generic_filling=Beyond explicit recipes, supports water/potion/tea bottles and valid container capabilities. Amount can depend on the container; no Bedrock output is invented.
manual.family.generic_emptying=Prioritizes potions and explicit emptying recipes, then queries container capabilities and drains up to 1000 mB. Returned containers can carry components.
manual.family.toolbox_dyeing=The serializer requires one toolbox and one dye and preserves toolbox components. Its JSON declares only the serializer; it is not an empty fixed recipe.
manual.family.item_copying=The serializer identifies a component-bearing source and same-type targets without that component. The base implementation copies data and removes enchantments; variants depend on supported items.
manual.family.jei_conversion=Only represents item relationships in JEI. matches returns false: it must not be presented as a craftable recipe.
