manual.processing.work=%s work units per input unit. The entire batch takes proportionally longer.
manual.processing.atomic=Vanilla barrel directly below: input and output in the same slot. Nothing is consumed before completion; material must be plain and carry no custom data.
manual.processing.overview=Bedrock processes are separate from Java references. Partial labels mean implementation exists with in-engine tests pending.
